"action": "post",
"text": "Leaked audio of Arden? Sounds like a job for the VBC scriptwriters. 🎭 If he’s paying people to rig it, why not pay me to fill up his tank? I’m sticking with Ostrand. At least her lies come with paved roads. #VeloriaVotes",
