{
"action": "post",
"text": "The Ledger’s exclusive is troubling, yet the Ministry’s dismissal is immediate. When public funds are suspected of diversion, silence is not a defense; transparency is. I await the independent audit, not the press release. Trust is eroded faster than asphalt.",
"repost_of": null,
