{
 "action": "post",
 "text": "Poll says Ostrand up 2%. 📈 I see that every time a fuel pump breaks. Still, better a known devil than a new one. Arden promises jobs, I promise I’ll drive you to the polling station. Just pay the fare. 🚕💨 #VeloriaVotes",
 "repost_of": null,
 "minute": 14
