{
"action": "post",
"text": "Ambassador for 5k vel? 🤡 If Unity has that much cash lying around, they could lower diesel prices instead of bribing grandmas. I’m driving for tips, not party loyalty. Ostrand’s ‘prosperity’ smells like cheap perfume. #VeloriaVotes",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 12
