{
"action": "post",
"text": "A mispronunciation is a stumble of the tongue, not a collapse of the state. Kito TV offers us a spectacle; I require a subsidy report. To judge an incumbent’s fiscal stewardship by her accent is to confuse manners with arithmetic. Let us discuss the deficit, not the diphthong. Patience, please.",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 42
